      "writtenOn": "2022-02-08T18:20:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, if we want to preserve existing behavior.\n\nI was just trying to keep this cl to only implementing \"configureall\" because it\u0027s probably not controversial. Whereas, testall seems like a barrel of fishhooks, in that what it currently does doesn\u0027t match the idea of XXXall should do what XXX does but for all applicable projects.",
      "parentUuid": "8c8e85f8_2b80ec96",
